── the six-decimal seam: 5e-7 is BELOW it, one step up is above ──
4.9999999999999998e-07  0.000000  (8 chars)
5e-07                    0.000000  (8 chars)
5.0000000000000008e-07   0.000001  (8 chars)
5.0000000000000019e-07   0.000001  (8 chars)
-4.9999999999999998e-07  -0.000000  (9 chars)
-5e-07                   -0.000000  (9 chars)
-5.0000000000000008e-07  -0.000001  (9 chars)
── the rule degenerates: every float under 5e-7 is 0.000000 ──
1e-07                    0.000000  (8 chars)
1e-08                    0.000000  (8 chars)
1e-300                   0.000000  (8 chars)
5e-324 least subnormal   0.000000  (8 chars)
2.2250738585072014e-308   0.000000  (8 chars)
-1e-300                   -0.000000  (9 chars)
── and at the top it stops being a decimal ──
1e15                     1000000000000000.000000  (23 chars)
1e16                     10000000000000000.000000  (24 chars)
1e22                     10000000000000000000000.000000  (30 chars)
12345678901234567890.0   12345678901234567168.000000  (27 chars)
1.7976931348623157e308   .000000  (316 chars)
── half rounding at .0f is half AWAY FROM ZERO, not to even ──
  0.500000  ->  .0f 0   .1f 0.5   .2f 0.50
  1.500000  ->  .0f 2   .1f 1.5   .2f 1.50
  2.500000  ->  .0f 2   .1f 2.5   .2f 2.50
  3.500000  ->  .0f 4   .1f 3.5   .2f 3.50
  0.050000  ->  .0f 0   .1f 0.1   .2f 0.05
  0.150000  ->  .0f 0   .1f 0.1   .2f 0.15
  0.250000  ->  .0f 0   .1f 0.2   .2f 0.25
  2.500000  ->  .0f 2   .1f 2.5   .2f 2.50
  -0.500000  ->  .0f -0   .1f -0.5   .2f -0.50
  -2.500000  ->  .0f -2   .1f -2.5   .2f -2.50
  -3.500000  ->  .0f -4   .1f -3.5   .2f -3.50
── the sign of a zero survives into the text ──
  bits                 -9223372036854775808
  tostring             -0.000000
  f"{nz}"                -0.000000
  f"{nz:.6f}"            -0.000000
  f"{nz:.1f}"            -0.0
  f"{nz:.0f}"            -0
  f"{nz:e}"              -0.000000e+00
  and +0.0 for contrast 0.000000  0
  f"{nz}" == tostring(nz)   true
── the manual's own examples ──
  f"{2.5}"                 2.500000
  f"{0.125:.2f}"           0.12
  f"{0.1:.20f}"            0.10000000000000000555
── a field with no spec IS tostring ──
  f"{x}" == tostring(x) on 15 of 15
